OL,3,GNEWSATeenager jailed for raping woman
OL,4,Ain beach toilet
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager has been jailed for raping a
OL,7,F19-year-old woman in a portable toilet
OL,8,Fon a seafront.
OL,10,FMohammed Abdullah, 19, from the West
OL,11,FDrayton area in Middlesex, was found
OL,12,Fguilty of raping and sexual assaulting
OL,13,Fthe woman by penetration on Bournemouth
OL,14,Fseafront in the early hours of 6 July
OL,15,F2025.
OL,17,FHe was sentenced to six years and nine
OL,18,Fmonths in prison and will also be
OL,19,Fplaced on the sex offenders register
OL,20,Ffor life.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
