OL,3,GNEWSATeenager jailed for raping woman
OL,4,Ain beach toilet
OL,5,
OL,6,FDet Insp Shaun Inkpen, of Dorset
OL,7,FPolice's Major Crime Investigation
OL,8,FTeam, said: "Throughout our
OL,9,Finvestigation and the subsequent
OL,10,Fcriminal justice process she [the
OL,11,Fvictim] has shown immense strength,
OL,12,Fcourage and resilience."
